      "text": "TCR HETERODIMER: α chain + β chain (non-covalent)\n  ─ Variable domains: VDJ-encoded → antigen recognition\n  ─ Constant domains: Cα + Cβ → membrane anchoring\n  ─ Short cytoplasmic tails: No signaling capacity"
