      "text": "CD3 COMPLEX (the signaling module):\n  TCR is non-covalently associated with CD3 complex:\n  CD3γ, CD3δ, CD3ε, CD3ζ (ζ-chain)\n  All have ITAMs in cytoplasmic tails"
    },
